cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the archived software release."
type: software
title: "XAI-DENFormer"
version: 1.0.0
license: GPL-3.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Nicolik/XAI-DENFormer"
url: "https://github.com/Nicolik/XAI-DENFormer"
abstract: >-
  XAI-DENFormer is a research software framework for dengue virus serotype
  classification from complete genomic sequences using chunk-based Transformer
  models and for downstream explainability analyses of learned genomic signals.
keywords:
  - dengue virus
  - genomic sequences
  - transformer
  - deep learning
  - explainable artificial intelligence
